---
title: Written Works
layout: novelIndex
override:tags: []
---
<p>If you want a simpler page, replace this page with the alternativeIndex.liquid page, that you can preview <a href="./alternativeIndex/">here</a>.</p>

{% for series in collections.novels %}
  <h2>{{ series.title }}</h2>

  <dl class="novel-list">
  {% for fic in series.stories %}
    <dt>
      <strong><a href="{{ fic.url }}">{{ fic.data.title }}</a></strong>
      {% if fic.data.r18 %}🔞{% endif %}
      {% if fic.data.last-updated %}<em> - Last Updated: {{ fic.data.last-updated | textDate }}</em>{% endif %}
    </dt>
    <dd>{{ fic.data.blurb }}</dd>
  {% endfor %}
  </dl>
{% endfor %}
